  "details": "If you for example build & publish on android, then switch over to windows and publish the last build, the android version of the build will get uploaded but labeled as the windows version. This results in people on PC being sent to their home world as soon as they join your world.\nA fix for this would be to simply add -quest or -PC at the filename end of the temporary stored builds, so it knows how to distinguish between them",
